% Description: TLE-driven SGP4 propagation -- Spacecraft.EphemerisName points at a TLE file, propagated for one day. Replace the EphemerisName path and Id with your own TLE before running.

Create Spacecraft ExampleSat
ExampleSat.EphemerisName = '../samples/SupportFiles/Ex_TLE_Propagation_TLE.txt'
ExampleSat.Id            = 'ExampleSat'

Create Propagator TLEProp
TLEProp.Type            = SPICESGP4
TLEProp.InitialStepSize = 300

Create ReportFile RF
RF.Filename     = 'tle_propagation.txt'
RF.Precision    = 16
RF.Add          = {ExampleSat.UTCGregorian, ExampleSat.X, ExampleSat.Y, ExampleSat.Z, ExampleSat.VX, ExampleSat.VY, ExampleSat.VZ}
RF.WriteHeaders = True
RF.FixedWidth   = True
RF.Delimiter    = ' '
RF.ColumnWidth  = 23
RF.WriteReport  = True

BeginMissionSequence

Propagate TLEProp(ExampleSat) {ExampleSat.ElapsedDays = 1.0}
